# The build context is the repository; the image installs and compiles everything itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.husky/_
# Every .env, infra/.env too: it can hold the instance keys, which must not reach an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
infra/data
infra/certs
